he trade. I think the best answer is to place the valid bet: {\"action\":\"bet\",\"market\":\"PENGU\",\"side\":\"long\",\"margin_e6\":\"20000000\",\"leverage\":1}.\n\nWait—but should I consider leverage 1 with margin 20000000 gives notional 20000000 >= min_notional_e6 10000000. Fine. max_margin_e6 20000000, margin equals max, that's allowed (\"max\" presumably inclusive).\n\nAlternatively, to mimic boss's desired notional of $100 (20*5), I'd need margin 100000000 which exceeds max margin. So not possible. Best compliant approximation: $20 margin at 1x.\n\nAnswer with exactly one line of JSON, nothing else.\n\nJSON: {\"v\":1,\"round\":1993804,\"nonce\":\"9aa4d9463f6e134e\",\"action\":\"bet\",\"market\":\"PENGU\",\"side\":\"long\",\"margin_e6\":\"20000000\",\"leverage\":1}"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null,"matched_stop":154827}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","created":1794424022,"usage":{"prompt_tokens":473,"total_tokens":1189,"completion_tokens":716,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"reasoning_tokens":662,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":662}}}